@startuml
title Rholang DDL to an Installed-Language Capability
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #334155
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam NoteBorderColor #94A3B8

component "Rholang **Module / Theory**\nAST or **language/2** value" as source #E0E7FF
component "resolved finite module diagram\nexact commitments · provenance" as diagram #DDD6FE
component "validated presentation\nscopes · morphisms · observations" as presentation #DBEAFE
component "canonical **GrammarCore**\nsemantic fingerprint" as core #DCFCE7
component "DFA / WPDA image\nexact witness weights" as image #BFDBFE
component "image verifier\nlimits · indices · equivalence" as verifier #A7F3D0
component "injected grants\npolicy · effects · cost" as grants #DDD6FE
component "atomic installed record\nopaque language handle" as handle #FBCFE8
component "FLT construct · match\nobserve · reduce · bridge" as flt #C7D2FE
component "theorem/profile checker\ntyped channel · datum · pattern · proof" as theorem #A7F3D0
component "reified RSpace capability\nstorage · synchronize · checkpoint · replay" as space #BFDBFE

source -[#334155]-> diagram : A1 resolve and pin
diagram -[#334155]-> presentation : A1 elaborate diagram
presentation -[#7C3AED,dashed]-> core : A4 functor + reflector laws
core -[#334155]-> image : A1 deterministic compile
image -[#334155]-> verifier : A1 untrusted derived cache
core -[#334155]-> verifier : A1 authoritative identity
grants -[#334155]-> verifier : A1 intersect requested rights
verifier -[#334155]-> handle : A1 one atomic commit
handle -[#334155]-> flt : A1 capability-scoped operations
handle -[#334155]-> theorem : A1 installed theory index
flt -[#334155]-> theorem : A1 scoped term / pattern + evidence
grants -[#334155]-> theorem : A1 proof-search and space rights
theorem -[#334155]-> space : A1 checked atomic operation
source -[#DC2626,dashed]-> flt : A5 ✗ specifications are not FLTs
source -[#DC2626,dashed]-> handle : A5 ✗ data cannot grant authority
source -[#DC2626,dashed]-> space : A5 ✗ a DDL cannot create storage authority

note bottom of verifier
  Any failure leaves no alias, image, handler,
  channel, right, or partially installed record.
end note

legend right
  |= Colour |= Concept (pinned palette, diagrams/PALETTE.md) |
  |<#E0E7FF> | **P3** Canonical specification value / Rholang DDL node |
  |<#DDD6FE> | **P11** Resolved modules and externally injected grants |
  |<#DBEAFE> | **P4** Shared presentation seam |
  |<#DCFCE7> | **P5** Fully declarative GrammarCore |
  |<#BFDBFE> | **P8** Runtime parser and reified-space substrate |
  |<#A7F3D0> | **P9** Fail-closed image and theorem verification gates |
  |<#FBCFE8> | **P10** Unforgeable installed identity |
  |<#C7D2FE> | **P13** Usable FLT operations |
  |<#F1F5F9> | **P14** Verification-scope note |
  |<#334155> | **A1** Ordinary dataflow |
  |<#7C3AED> | **A4** Proof / equality obligation (dashed) |
  |<#DC2626> | **A5** Forbidden authority path (dashed, leading ✗) |
endlegend
@enduml
